1
00:00:00,435 --> 00:00:04,965
(Amy:)I only used urban slang to sound tough
so people wouldn't break in.

2
00:00:05,206 --> 00:00:06,396
(Sheldon:)It's not the message.

3
00:00:06,607 --> 00:00:10,067
(Amy:)Well, what is it then?
I did everything just the way you like it.

4
00:00:10,278 --> 00:00:12,938
- You did.
- Then what the hell, Sheldon?

5
00:00:15,616 --> 00:00:19,916
(Amy:)We have been going out for over two years,
and I've been nothing but patient with you.

6
00:00:20,121 --> 00:00:24,081
(Amy:)I watch your dopey space movies,
I signed your ridiculous contracts.

7
00:00:24,292 --> 00:00:27,782
I stopped wearing lip gloss because
you said it made my mouth look slippery.

8
00:00:29,964 --> 00:00:32,434
(Amy:)I am the best girlfriend
you're ever gonna have.

9
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:35,223
(Amy:)You give me one good reason
why I can't live here.

10
00:00:36,737 --> 00:00:38,367
(Sheldon:)It's Penny's fault.

11
00:00:39,107 --> 00:00:41,237
(Leonard:)- What?
- She doesn't wanna live with Leonard...

12
00:00:41,442 --> 00:00:44,972
(Sheldon:)...so he has to come live here again.
She's the snake in our garden.

13
00:00:46,147 --> 00:00:48,017
(Sheldon:)She's the reason we can't be happy.

14
00:00:51,119 --> 00:00:52,949
(Amy:)- Hey, Ames.
- Yeah, "Hey, Ames" nothing.

15
00:00:53,154 --> 00:00:55,914
(Amy:)I was all set to move in
with Sheldon and I can't because...

16
00:00:56,090 --> 00:01:00,020
- ...you don't wanna live with Leonard.
- What?

